---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Photo from "@/components/Photo.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service — Indian Keto"
  description="Terms of service for Indian Keto. Read our terms and conditions for using indianketo.com."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 pt-10 sm:px-6 sm:pt-14">
    <p class="badge badge-primary">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="mt-4 font-display text-4xl font-semibold text-primary sm:text-5xl">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-neutral-900/70">Last updated: August 2026</p>
  </section>

  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 pt-8 sm:px-6">
    <Photo
      slug="masala-dabba"
      class="aspect-[16/6] w-full rounded-3xl"
      widths={[480, 768, 1200]}
      sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 64rem, 100vw"
      eager={true}
    />
  </div>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-10 sm:px-6 sm:py-14">
    <div class="prose prose-lg prose-keto">
      <p>By accessing indianketo.com you agree to these terms.</p>
      <h2>Content is informational</h2>
      <p>Everything on Indian Keto is published for general information. We are not medical professionals and nothing here is medical advice. Talk to your own healthcare provider before changing your diet, especially if you take medication for diabetes or blood pressure.</p>
      <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
      <p>Indian Keto participates in affiliate programmes. When you click an affiliate link and buy something, we may earn a commission. See our <a href="/disclosure">disclosure page</a> for the details.</p>
      <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
      <p>Our articles and recipe text are the property of Indian Keto. Photographs are used under their own licences and belong to their creators — each one is credited with its licence and source on the <a href="/disclosure#photo-credits">credits page</a>. Do not reuse a photograph on the strength of finding it here; check its licence at the source first.</p>
      <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>Indian Keto is not liable for any damages arising from use of this website or reliance on the information it contains.</p>
      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>We may update these terms. Continued use of the site after a change constitutes acceptance of the revised terms.</p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>For questions about these terms, email <a href="mailto:hello@indianketo.com">hello@indianketo.com</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
